      "side": 1,
      "message": "This could get expensive if a client has dozens/hundreds of rules, because each rule will require an allocation and a memory copy, and the allocations will all need to be garbage collected immediately after this method completes.\n\nBpfMap#forEach allows the passed-in BiConsumer to delete the entries as they are being iterated over, could we use that here?\n\nNot for this CL, but perhaps add a TODO?",
